<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY'S RIZIKO FACTORY APPLIES FOR LISTING.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY'S RIZIKO FACTORY APPLIES FOR LISTING.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Riziko Factory Altalanos Spekulativ Rt lodged its apply to the Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) to list its stocks, the BSE said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company lodged its request to the BSE on Wednesday to introduce 84,436 shares with 10,000 forint face value each in the listed &quot;B&quot; category, it said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
